00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:13.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-The Guthrie program.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.208
-So these were theater schools.
-These were theater schools.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You´re coming from
South Carolina.

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
-17 years old.
-Uh-huh.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:20.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s, like, 40 people
