00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-Yo, and....

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.434
I was like, "Okay, I´m just
kidding, it´s Danielle."

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.436
And it took -- from Guthrie --

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
